ke suggestions to your partner about visiting your city."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. "}]}], "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "At the Travel Agent"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Talking About the Holiday"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Here and There > The Travel Agency"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information, involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use suggestions when you want to tell people what you think they should do. </br>You can make suggestions using a modal, like <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span>.<br/>Here are some examples of making and responding to suggestions:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making a Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\"><span class = \\\"italic\\\">How about \u2026 ?</span><br/>You should \u2026 <br/>Why not \u2026 ?<br/>You could ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\"><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Good idea.</span><br/>Great suggestion.<br/>OK.<br/><br/>I don't know \u2026<br/>I'd rather not \u2026<br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Mm, I don't like ... </span></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Bill</span>: How about visiting the ruins?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Jeff</span>: I don't know ... I'd prefer to go to the beach."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Taking a Tour"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In many parts of the world, people like to take tours in a group with a tour guide. They travel together and learn about different places from a person.<br/><br/>In North America, it is very common for people, especially young people, to travel alone or with a friend. They prefer the freedom and independence of this.<br/><br/>What about people in your country? Do they travel with a tour guide or alone?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short journey to a place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have some ideas for your trip to Mexico."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about travel."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brochure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small book or magazine with pictures and information about a product or service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I saw a brochure at the mall about Mexico."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "landmark"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object or feature of a town that is easy to see"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many landmarks in Mexico City."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ruins"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the pieces of a building that was destroyed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How about visiting the ancient ruins?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tour guide"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who shows you the places and things in a city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You could go with a tour guide."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "monument"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building or statue that honors a person or event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many monuments in Mexico City."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "holiday"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a vacation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to go on a holiday to Mexico."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "attraction"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a popular place to visit "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many attractions in Mexico City."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le04ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Greet your partner. Imagine your partner is new to your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make suggestions about where they can go and what they can do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make 4-5 suggestions in different ways."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Conclude your conversation."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make 4-5 suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use different phrases to make suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my city with my partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}